# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Lodestar — only ship what the addon (and CurseForge) actually needs.
# Dev tooling, build data, internal docs and art sources stay LOCAL.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Guide generator + validator + the large Questie data dumps (dev only).
# Exceções: o gerador e o teste do port para o Forever — quem revisa precisa rodar.
tools/*
!tools/gen_forever.py
!tools/forever-guides.lua

# Internal documentation (not shipped) — specs, plans, design notes stay LOCAL
DSL.md
PACKAGING.md
# Exceção: o que o README linka.
docs/*
!docs/forever.md

# Art sources / previews — the shipped textures are the .tga files
*.zip
HUD-preview.html
lodestar-glyphs/*.png
lodestar-icones/*.png
Media/*.zip
Media/*.html

# Packager output
.release/

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.bak
*.tmp
*.swp
*~

# relatório de auditoria (local)
AUDIT_REPORT.html
